#: ../../source/6-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:48
#: 4207e24a69c24175b76964fd3148877a
msgid ""
"Composer **does not implement Nav2 servers**. `nav.*` skills wrap "
"**`ROS2RobotInterface`’s Nav2 client API**. Scene-level launch is separate "
"from the task YAML."
msgstr ""
"composer **不实现 Nav2 服务端**。`nav.*` 技能封装的是 **`ROS2RobotInterface` 的 Nav2 客户端 "
"API**。场景级 launch 与任务 YAML 分开。"

