msgstr ""
"运控 preset：`ocs2-fullbody` / `ocs2-split-body` / "
"`ocs2-demo`（`ocs2_arm_controller` 的 launch）。"

#: ../../source/6-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:55
#: bd8a2d256d9d4aedaed01ada5a21bfd9
msgid ""
"Navigation: `navigation.profile` `default` or `map_only` expands to "
"**`nav2_profile:=…`**. Default launch: `robot_common_launch` / "
"**`navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`**."
msgstr ""
"导航：`navigation.profile` 为 `default` 或 `map_only`，展开成 "
"**`nav2_profile:=…`**。默认 launch：`robot_common_launch` / "
"**`navigation_isaac_gt.launch.py`**。"

#: ../../source/6-synthetic_data/2-orchestration.md:56
#: 5204e9d745234f75be71fcbe47a80cbc
msgid ""
"`navigation.required: auto` starts Nav2 only when the `task_queue` contains "
